# an AndroidKeyStore attestation chain is device-unique material: imported from outside, never committed
# (see example_binaries/metasec/device/keystore/README.md; the published profile names no chain at all)
/unidbg-android/src/test/resources/example_binaries/metasec/device/keystore/*.der
/unidbg-android/src/test/resources/example_binaries/metasec/device/keystore/*.pem
/unidbg-android/src/test/resources/example_binaries/metasec/device/keystore/*.p12
# the app's own signing certificate: the local badger/register drivers md5 it; not needed by the published demo
/unidbg-android/src/test/resources/example_binaries/metasec/device/apk_signing_cert.der
